---
import { siteMetadata } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="about" class="reveal px-6 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-5">
    <div class="mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-muted">About</div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-offwhite md:text-3xl">Precision and clarity in every release.</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-offwhite/80">
      <p>
        I shape full-stack experiences for teams that need predictability without sacrificing feel.
        Every page is optimized for fast paint, accessible flows, and transparent instrumentation.
      </p>
      <p>
        I collaborate closely with product, design, and platform to align runtime budgets with
        business KPIs and spend cycles.
      </p>
      <p>
        From component libraries to deploy pipelines, the focus is always on measurable impact and
        clarity in delivery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
